This will allow you to change all users UPN to a new email domain

Pre-Requisites
MSOL-SERVICE powershell module installed
All users will be expected to logout of any current sessions and relogon once this script is completed

Export all MsolUser -All | Export-CSV "PATH TO CSV"

Add additional column in the output with title "NewUserPrincipalName"

Copy the entire column of UserPrincipalName and paste a duplicate column  

Find and replace old domain with new domain on the NewUserPrincipalName column only

Open ChangeAllUsersUPN.ps1 in ISE session connected to your Azure AD using the MSOL-SERVICE and a Global Admin role user account

Insert path to your exported and updated CSV file

Run script

